{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49255","headline":"河传 二 · 温庭筠","name":"河传 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖上，闲望。\n雨萧萧，烟浦花桥路遥。\n谢娘翠蛾愁不销，终朝，梦魂迷晚潮。\n荡子天涯归櫂远，春已晚，鸎语空肠断。\n若耶溪，溪水西，柳堤，不闻郎马嘶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}